WEBVTT

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:47.280
<b>Sewing Room</b>

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:46.760
Okay, let's get changed 
and get this over with.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:52.470
Man, I just can't let my 
guard down with them around.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.840
You know, Madam Aoi?

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.400
True, true...

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.930
This sucks.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.600
How'd we end up like this?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:02.710
Oga...

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:05.410
This I swear...

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:08.310
I feel like my entire life 
has led up to this moment...

00:02:08.790 --> 00:02:12.230
If my life ends here, so be it!

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:14.980
What the hell are you saying 
stuck under a desk?!

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.620
This is all your damn fault! Do something!

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.990
Mother, thank you for giving birth to me!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.690
Hey! Are you even listening to me?

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:27.150
Furuichi here.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:30.410
What exactly led up to 
this situation, you ask?

00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:34.230
It all started about one hour ago...

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.820
Physicals?

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:44.010
Yes. Instead of class this afternoon.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:46.640
And what does that have to do with us?

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:51.010
Usually the measurements are taken by the 
assigned student health representative,

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:55.770
but we can't waste the time of one of our 
serious students on you future dropouts.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.120
I'm busy with a lot of things myself.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.150
You two class reps handle your 
class's measurements yourselves.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.990
You'll do it in the room next 
to the teachers' office...

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.760
Stop pulling on that, Baby Beel!

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.320
Are you listening to me?!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.880
Oh, sure I am...

00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:15.500
This guy...

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.240
He thinks I'm a pushover!

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:21.880
Whatever...

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:26.390
There's no way they'll be 
able to do a proper physical.

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.620
Run a little bit amok, 
and your asses are mine.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.290
A one-way ticket to expulsion!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:39.860
<b>Let's All Get Physicals!</b>

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.560
Give it a rest!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.820
Madam Aoi, what did you call us out here for?

00:03:46.820 --> 00:03:49.060
We've been told to do physical exams.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.870
Physicals?

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:59.000
Yeah... And we class reps were told 
to do everyone's physicals ourselves.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.550
But...

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.200
Isn't he squirming a little more than usual?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.510
He's bored!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.940
Since we transferred, we haven't 
been allowed to make trouble.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:14.620
He's agitated and pisses himself all day.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.480
I said not to pull that!

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:23.610
I'd rather not... But wouldn't 
it be better if we helped?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.140
The guy's measurements...

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:28.970
Yeah.

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.970
Go on ahead and get ready.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:33.370
I'll go call the rest of the class.

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.260
One warning:

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.880
Whatever you do, don't make a scene.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.690
Sadohara's acting like he'll make 
a big deal out of any trouble.

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.770
Good night, little kitty.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.270
How'd you like to have a 
nice dream together with me?

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:57.060
Um...

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.590
I don't know what you're saying actually.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:03.270
And why do you use such half-assed English?

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.780
Y-You...

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.780
...total idiots!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.550
Move that over there...

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:10.780
<b>Sewing Room</b>

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.400
That's the way, Baby Beel! Close in!

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.290
Watch out for his punches!

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.880
Baby Beel!

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:29.120
Straighten up!

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:31.700
Straighten up, Baby Beel!

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.140
You mean stand up, right?

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:36.140
Use your legs, get set, 
and then, all at once...

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.020
Just tell him to, "stand up"!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:38.980
Are you doing this on purpose?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.990
What're you givin' me that look for?

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.440
You wanna go, buddy?

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:57.900
He did a pretty sweet re-enacting of 
my fight with Tojo, don't you think?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.170
So then, that's Lamia...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.750
Above is Furcas...

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.370
Beside him is Hilda-san...

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:06.920
Alaindelon, and then, what?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.590
Is that thing supposed to be me?

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.780
What's with that horrible face?

00:06:10.780 --> 00:06:12.280
Why's it riding a car?

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:14.600
Like, totally hardcore!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:17.880
Why're there so many stuffed 
animals here, Nene-san?

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.020
Yeah...

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:22.610
Looks like this room is usually 
used for the arts and crafts club.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.740
Chiaki, carry that.

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:25.370
Right.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.090
Oga... I'm so happy right now.

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:34.840
The girls are gonna do the boys' physicals.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:36.250
This is what I'm talking about!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.250
I've been missing these 
kinds of school-year events!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:40.350
There've been so few!

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:43.230
Hey, boys! Stop gawking and start helping.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:44.980
Yeah, Oga-chi!

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.520
This is your job in the first place!

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:48.400
Sure!

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.510
I'll help!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.020
But before that...

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:52.360
W-What's...

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.850
Could you take that, 
"Hey, boys!" from before,

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:59.540
raise your pitch a little, 
and go, "Hey, boys~" for me?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.940
Hey, you dickheads!

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.980
Each and every one of you!

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:12.990
M-Madam Aoi...

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:14.660
We're getting this over with!

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:15.490
Get ready.

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:16.990
Right.

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:22.790
Queen, no mercy as always.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.670
Man, what a pain.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.370
W-What are you doing?

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.680
If we're doing physicals, we gotta 
change out of our clothes, yeah?

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:40.180
If you're gonna change, 
go do it in the corner!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.450
About 1.8 meters.

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.640
G-Good night...

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:04.960
How about it, Furuichi? 
This making you happy?

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:09.460
It's not quite what I'd hoped for.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.580
You sure it's okay like this?

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:14.360
I said it's fine.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.660
Hurry up and do it.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:16.470
Okay...

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:23.480
Uh... One meter and...

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.270
O-One meter and...

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:34.740
You jerks!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:39.560
Hey, keep it down.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.140
The teachers' office is next door, you know.

00:08:41.140 --> 00:08:43.490
Hey, back off!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:50.750
What?

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.400
I guess you're one of those where 
the clothes make you lose a few...

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:10.010
What was that noise?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.640
Whatever...

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:14.360
If they cause any problems, then...

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:17.490
Okay, finished!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.460
When you two are done changing, get out!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.050
The girls are next.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.120
It's over already?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.760
We're going to get changed.

00:09:27.010 --> 00:09:31.750
So since the girls helped the guys, 
that means the guys'll help the...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:32.590
Shut up!

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.640
You okay there?

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.120
Get out of here, freak!

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.620
Come on, Baby Beel. Let's go.

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:03.900
Hey!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.420
Baby Beel, what's wrong?

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.080
Hey, Baby Beel!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.350
What're you doing?

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:15.430
Hey, Furuichi! Stop being 
unconscious and help me!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:16.840
Baby Beel's shut himself in a locker!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.150
Huh? What?

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.770
What'd you do?

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:22.470
I didn't do anything!

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.020
Hey, Baby Beel, open up!

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.810
Hey!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.730
What the hell...

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:34.900
T-They've come back!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:38.720
Man, I just can't let my 
guard down with them around.

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:40.600
You idiot! Why are we hiding?

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.990
Shouldn't we explain what's going on?

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:44.810
Seriously...

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.240
Let's get this over with.

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:47.630
Yeah...

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:50.810
This sucks.

00:10:50.810 --> 00:10:52.570
How'd we end up like this?

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:06.270
Hey Baby Beel! It's lunchtime!

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:10.270
Damn it...

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:11.870
Hey, Furuichi.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.110
How about you do something?

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.670
Furuichi here.

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:19.040
And that's how we got into this situation.

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.240
H-Hey!

00:11:21.770 --> 00:11:25.530
Madam Aoi, you have such a 
slender body as always...

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.540
Stop touching me, okay?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.460
Why not? Just a little...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.460
Oga...

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:30.410
What?

00:11:30.730 --> 00:11:32.370
I want your opinion.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.210
In this context, what do you 
think slender refers to?

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.840
Take this seriously, you dunce!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.800
You idiot! We'll be found out!

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:41.310
Did you say something?

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:44.600
Uh, about your slender body...

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.180
No, not that...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.170
And stop touching me!

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.370
Okay, okay!

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:53.260
Anyway, we have to continue to coax 
him out without them noticing!

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.940
That's the only choice we have!

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.190
Hey, Baby Beel! Come out!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.190
I'll give you a piggyback ride or whatever!

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.950
<b>Piggyback</b>

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:13.660
Oh, Chiaki... Did you grow a little bigger?

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:14.580
Really?

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.490
And wait, didn't you get bigger, Nene-san?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.350
Me? No, I haven't changed.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.780
That's right, Baby Beel! Come on out!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.750
What are you doing, Oga?

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.620
And what the hell do you think <i>you</i> are doing?

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.800
He was so close to coming out!

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:39.280
Screw you, asshole!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:42.130
N-No! I didn't do it on purpose!

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.460
You're up next, Madame Aoi.

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.490
Madame Aoi?

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.100
Oh, sorry...

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.510
Crap... He ain't coming out...

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:56.130
Crap... I can't see squat...

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:57.560
That's not the problem!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:12:59.760
Okay, let's put the desks back.

00:13:00.140 --> 00:13:01.880
Where did this desk go?

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.880
W-What'll we do?

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:06.890
It's sink or swim...

00:13:16.090 --> 00:13:18.320
It was basically like this.

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:19.690
Right.

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:22.680
All that's left is to take 
the records to the teacher.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.840
H-Hey! Don't come out now!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:29.450
Go back!

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.970
Phew...

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.530
I-I thought I was dead meat...

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.070
God damn it!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.270
All that's left is...

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:56.590
Hey, Baby Beel!

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.460
How long are you gonna be in there?

00:13:58.460 --> 00:14:00.140
Come on out already!

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.200
Come on, Baby Beel!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.970
Hey, Oga... Isn't this...?

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.310
What are you two doing?

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:29.000
A-And, why are you in the classroom?!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.350
Don't tell me, that sound from before was...

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.590
Wait! Hold it...

00:14:35.590 --> 00:14:36.810
Calm down.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.690
You expect me to <i>stay calm</i>?!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:45.440
Looks like they finally went and did it.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.090
I can't believe this!

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:49.690
What the hell were you doing?!

00:14:49.690 --> 00:14:51.300
Where were you peeping from?

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.330
N-No, we didn't see anything!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:55.330
I didn't see any slender bodies at all!

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:10.380
H-Hey!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.850
You needn't worry. I'll 
make sure it's painless.

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:18.310
What was that noise? A fight?

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:21.900
S-Sensei! I'm saved...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.310
What? What are you talking about?

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:27.320
What the hell is this?!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.770
Oh, it's nothing...

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:32.330
The desks seem to have become brittle.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.650
What? That's not...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.200
See?

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.960
That's why I was about to clean up.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.380
Isn't that right, Furuichi-kun?

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:46.680
Yes!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.590
But...

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:51.380
These are the results for the class physical.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.950
Please check them over.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:57.030
You're leaving already?

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.060
What? You need me for something?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:00.950
Nope!

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.340
Thanks for your hard work...

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:04.280
Sheesh.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.280
Now then...

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:11.730
I'm telling you to listen to me!

00:16:11.980 --> 00:16:13.490
Baby Beel is still...

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.220
Where'd he go?

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.870
What the hell does he think he's doing?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.080
Hey! You trying to escape?

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.130
I told you, you've got it wrong!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.630
I'll explain to you later.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:30.740
H-Hey! Hold it!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.640
What is the matter with him?

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:34.840
Now then, I'll just...

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:40.750
Oh? Where do you think you're going?

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.430
U-Um...

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:47.130
Damn! I just can't catch them out!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:48.590
Hey, Baby Beel!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:56.290
Oh, yeah... Why does that bastard 
Oga have a kid with him anyway?

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:07.510
Look at him! Loitering around buck naked!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:11.040
Hey, he's messing with someone's car!

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:14.770
That car looks just like the 
car I worked so hard to buy...

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.980
Ah... He opened the door and went inside!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.910
And now here comes Oga, too...

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.100
Now <i>he's</i> messing with the car?

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:27.190
Well, sucks to be that guy, 
but at least it's not my car.

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.600
Maybe I'll head to the roof and cool my head.

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:38.520
Yeah, a man's car is like 
his shining jewel...

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:40.620
It's an extension of himself.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.290
Hey! Come out of there, Baby Beel!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.570
Nothing is worse than 
having your car soiled

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:50.440
by some random person after 
you've polished it to a shine.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:55.990
And besides, my car is really 
valuable! Only a few in all of Japan!

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:58.120
It's already a treasure on earth...

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.110
I mean, seriously...

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.450
So, I wonder how my mom's doing?

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:08.440
She was always telling me when I was a kid...

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:12.630
"Watch out, 'cause you have times 
you avoid facing harsh realities..."

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:14.320
Open the damn door!

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:17.820
Yeah, my mom wasn't lying, was she?

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:21.100
Thank you, Mom. I've been running away.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:25.540
That's my car, isn't it?!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.710
Hey, Baby Beel! What are you doing?

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.910
What the hell kind of smug look 
is that? Get out here now!

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:50.940
What're you doing?

00:18:51.370 --> 00:18:52.360
Hey!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.690
Hey! What the hell are you doing?

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.970
Uh, the door won't open.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.640
I-It's broken! What have you done?

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.200
I ain't done anything!

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.630
Do you have any idea how 
expensive this car is?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.000
It's a 10-year loan!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.900
Not my problem.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:17.690
Damn it! Well, if you do anything 
else to this car, you're...

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.180
What the...

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:27.180
Now's not the time to spring a leak!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:30.290
A leak?! What are you...

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.970
Sensei, when a baby springs 
a leak, it's you know...

00:19:33.970 --> 00:19:34.760
You know, pi...

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:37.190
Don't say it! I don't want to know!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.950
Whatever.

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.090
I'll have to split it... 
Like Momotaro's peach.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:44.000
What? Split it? Did you just say split it?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.830
Don't worry, Sensei. I'll 
split it nice and clean.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.840
Oh... That's a load off...

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:49.930
...of crap!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.980
Stop it! I told you I have a 10-year loan!

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:56.800
And if you do any more harm to a 
teacher's car, you're expelled!

00:19:57.060 --> 00:19:58.050
Expelled?

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.160
Sensei...

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:08.310
I told you not to worry. 
I'll split it cleanly.

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.450
Are you listening? Are you an idiot?

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.220
I am an idiot!

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:12.430
Oh, that's why...

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:13.420
...hell no!

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:15.900
Oga, Peach Splittin' Chop!

00:20:20.390 --> 00:20:21.780
My loan!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.020
Silly me! I should have 
just opened it this way.

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:28.960
Come here.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:33.170
You're drenched in pee!

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:34.820
That's gross.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:40.030
Sheesh... Let's go back.

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:43.530
Uh, first... You didn't open the door!

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:45.940
Listen, I'm gonna make 
this a problem for you!

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:47.680
You're gonna be expelled for sure!

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:50.260
Do you understand this, Oga?

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.440
<b>Principal's Office</b>

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:59.440
What do you mean it's not a problem?

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:06.220
After all, Sadohara-sensei, one punch 
could never demolish an entire car.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:08.400
Nobody would believe that.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:11.110
He's a normal high-school student yes?

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:13.970
Well, yeah... But it's the truth!

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:15.460
He actually...!

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:17.990
You said it was a very high-priced car...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:21.450
I can understand your frustration, at least.

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:24.970
That's not the problem!

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:56.980
<b>Special Class</b>

00:22:55.300 --> 00:22:56.980
That's what it was?

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:00.230
You should have just explained 
the situation to me.

00:23:00.480 --> 00:23:04.480
Wasn't it you who attacked me 
before I had a chance to explain?

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:07.870
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:10.360
I'm sorry... I'm sorry...

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:12.440
Don't go too crazy now, Baby Beel.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:17.160
It's all because you locked 
yourself up like that.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:19.130
That's why it happened.

00:23:20.090 --> 00:23:23.810
By the way... You didn't 
actually see anything, right?

00:23:23.810 --> 00:23:25.590
I didn't see a thing.

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:28.040
Sheesh...

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:30.820
Here.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:34.100
You dropped this yesterday... Is it his?

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:39.950
Never seen the thing...

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:43.980
Baby Beel?

00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:49.990
Baby Beel!

00:24:04.130 --> 00:24:05.130
What's wrong, Baby Beel?

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:09.210
He's crying to let him join 
in the preview this time.

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:13.010
Okay, got it! You try doing 
the preview this time!

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:19.570
Crap, this isn't previewing anything.

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:22.020
On the next Beelzebub: What 
Are the 6 Holy Knights?

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:24.520
So there are strong guys 
even at St. Ishiyama?

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:26.820
These 6 Holy Knights sound like fun!
